Read e-books and documents, with a view built for e-ink screens

KOReader is a document viewer made for e-ink readers that also runs on desktop computers. It opens both fixed-layout and reflowable formats and gives you detailed control over how text is laid out.

- PDF, DjVu, CBZ, EPUB, FB2, Mobi, DOC, RTF, HTML and more
- Reflows scanned PDF and DjVu documents
- Custom margins, line spacing, fonts and hyphenation
- Calibre integration, including wireless transfer and OPDS catalogues
- Extensible with plugins
